  "claim": "For any admitted finite tokenomics trace, if each reward/rebate/bounty/buyback step is funded by newly verified value plus treasury or resource drawdown, then cumulative spend over the trace is bounded by cumulative verified value gained plus initial treasury. If cumulative spend exceeds that bound, the stepwise funding predicate is impossible. A reward controller guard packages nonnegative reward spend, nonnegative verified value gain, and the fail-closed aggregate spend bound.",
